Package: hallberg2025.meth.data
Title: Pre-computed Methylation Data Objects for Hallberg et al. 2025 Ovarian Subtypes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rob", "Scharpf", , "rscharpf@jhu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4702-2656"))
Description: Companion data package for Hallberg et al. 2025 (Cancer Research
    Communications). Provides the methylation SummarizedExperiment consumed by
    the manuscript pipeline in cancer-genomics/hallberg2025. The data-raw/
    directory contains the generating pipeline (targets-based), which verifies
    reproducibility back through successive raw-data frontiers, one generation
    at a time -- see provenance/methylation_provenance_verification_plan.md in
    the source (private) repository for the full provenance DAG and step sequence.
License: GPL-3
